<section class="hero"><div>
<h1>Forecast revenue you can defend in the boardroom.</h1>
<p style="color: rgb(74, 84, 112) !important; max-width: 34em !important; font-size: 20px !important; line-height: 1.55 !important;">Acme connects your CRM, billing and product data, then flags the deals and accounts that will move your number.</p>
<div class="ctas"><button class="btn b1" style="background: none rgb(51, 65, 196) !important; color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important; border-radius: 12px !important; border: 0px !important; padding: 18px 30px !important; font-size: 17px !important; font-weight: 700 !important; box-shadow: rgba(51, 65, 196, 0.6) 0px 10px 24px -8px !important; text-decoration: none !important;">Start free trial</button><button class="btn b3" style="background: none transparent !important; color: rgb(15, 22, 48) !important; border: 0px !important; box-shadow: none !important; padding: 18px 8px !important; font-size: 16px !important; font-weight: 600 !important; text-decoration: underline 2px !important; text-underline-offset: 5px !important;">Or book a 20-minute demo</button><button class="btn b4" style="display: none !important;">Watch video</button><button class="btn b2" style="display: none !important;">Talk to sales</button></div>
</div><div class="mock"><div class="bar" style="width:40%"></div><div class="bar" style="width:70%"></div><div class="chart"></div><div class="bar" style="width:55%"></div></div></section>
<section class="features"><h2>What changes for your revenue team in week one</h2>
<div class="card"><h3>Unified data layer</h3><p>Sync data from every system you use into one governed model.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Catch revenue leaks the day they start</h3><p>Get notified when metrics move outside their expected range.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Call the quarter with confidence</h3><p>Model pipeline and revenue scenarios with built-in forecasting.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Dashboards</h3><p>Build dashboards with drag and drop widgets and share them.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Permissions</h3><p>Control who sees what with granular role-based access.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Integrations</h3><p>Connect over 120 tools with native integrations.</p></div></section>
<section class="band"><h2 style="color: rgb(255, 255, 255) !important;">Grows with you from first dashboard to enterprise</h2><p>Acme Insights processes billions of events every month for teams of every size. Our platform is designed to grow with you.</p></section>

